stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "草稿" as Draft
    state "待确认" as Pending
    state "执行中" as Active
    state "已完成" as Done
    state "已归档" as Archived

    [*] --> Draft: 生成草案
    Draft --> Pending: 校验完成
    Pending --> Draft: 改约束后重生成
    Pending --> Active: 学生确认（生成 v1）
    Active --> Active: 打卡
    Active --> Done: 当前目标全部必做任务完成
    Active --> Archived: 调整生效（旧版转历史）
    note right of Active
        逾期与冲突为派生标记
        不改变执行状态
    end note
    Archived --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
